/****************************************************************************
 * Name: ui_build_iron
 *
 * Tab2: big temp + power readout, dual curves (temp & power),
 * temperature slider + target label, PID button.
 *
 * Layout (480 x 177 content):
 *   y 2..40   : left big temp "348C" | right "65%" power + status
 *   y 44..120 : temperature chart (full width 464)
 *   y 126..156: slider row: [100] ----o---- [480]  + "350C" target
 *   y 160..175: PID button + ON/OFF button
 ****************************************************************************/

/****************************************************************************
